      "steps": [
        {
          "kind": "tip",
          "title": "Identifying São Tomé & Príncipe",
          "items": [
            {
              "kind": "centeredImage",
              "id": "bCCq",
              "imageUrl": "/images/sao-tome-and-principe/0_st_summary.png"
            },
            {
              "kind": "tip",
              "id": "mteu",
              "data": {
                "image": {
                  "imageUrl": "/images/sao-tome-and-principe/st_shit.png",
                  "imageLink": "https://goo.gl/maps/LTkTMgjD7rxFCcgE8",
                  "alt": "",
                  "width": 0.5
                },
                "text": [
                  "All the coverage was taken with a low quality camera that’s commonly referred to as “Shitcam”. The car will often be completely blurred, with a **very large blur** covering the back and a [somewhat smaller blur](https://goo.gl/maps/YfaEf11wuzdt3NYv8) covering the front.",
                  "NOTE: The coverage is a newer variant of shitcam, where the image is dimmer and hazier than the original shitcam primarily found in [India](https://maps.app.goo.gl/3MYW94icKvwhWTc66) and [Nigeria](https://maps.app.goo.gl/eETqUgMHvyiCR4di8)."
                ]
              }
            },
            {
              "kind": "tip",
              "id": "EmV2",
              "data": {
                "image": {
                  "imageUrl": "/images/sao-tome-and-principe/st_language.png",
                  "imageLink": "/images/sao-tome-and-principe/st_language.png",
                  "alt": "",
                  "width": 0.5
                },
                "text": [
                  "**Portuguese** is the main language used on São Tomé and Príncipe."
                ]
              }
            },
            {
              "kind": "tip",
              "id": "8u6S",
              "data": {
                "image": {
                  "imageUrl": "/images/sao-tome-and-principe/st_polepedestriancrossing.png",
                  "imageLink": "https://goo.gl/maps/4ojwFdj6pSKUkbeF8",
                  "alt": "",
                  "width": 0.5
                },
                "text": [
                  "On top of the language, the Portuguese influence can also be seen in infrastructure, such as ladder poles and pedestrian signs with the same design as in Portugal."
                ]
              },
              "tags": [
                "pole"
              ]
            },
            {
              "kind": "tip",
              "id": "Iix7",
              "data": {
                "image": {
                  "imageUrl": "/images/sao-tome-and-principe/st_tropical.png",
                  "imageLink": "https://goo.gl/maps/qjvx6rFCZPN7M3QdA",
                  "alt": "",
                  "width": 0.5
                },
                "text": [
                  "São Tomé and Príncipe are **tropical islands**, which are almost completely covered in rainforests. Banana plants are especially common throughout the islands."
                ]
              }
            },
            {
              "kind": "tip",
              "id": "ij58",
              "data": {
                "image": {
                  "imageUrl": "/images/sao-tome-and-principe/antenna.png",
                  "imageLink": "https://maps.app.goo.gl/4VeKVBatyNNenp8y9",
                  "alt": "",
                  "width": 0.5
                },
                "text": [
                  "In many locations, you will notice a **slanted antenna** protruding from the side of the car."
                ]
              }
            },
            {
              "kind": "tip",
              "id": "0mhZ",
              "data": {
                "image": {
                  "imageUrl": "/images/sao-tome-and-principe/st_bluepolepaint.png",
                  "imageLink": "https://goo.gl/maps/6x7TkiEeH4v4XSGL7",
                  "alt": "",
                  "width": 0.5
                },
                "text": [
                  "Some wooden poles are painted **blue **on the bottom. You can also read the letters **CST **on them."
                ]
              },
              "tags": [
                "pole"
              ]
            },
            {
              "kind": "tip",
              "id": "1MAM",
              "data": {
                "image": {
                  "imageUrl": "/images/sao-tome-and-principe/yellow_taxi_sao_tome.png",
                  "imageLink": "https://maps.app.goo.gl/JkNYuG5P1kwrHWMa8",
                  "alt": "",
                  "width": 0.5
                },
                "text": [
                  "Taxis and minibuses are painted in a **bright yellow** colour."
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "kind": "tip",
          "title": "Region-specific clues",
          "items": [
            {
              "kind": "tip",
              "id": "oaFS",
              "data": {
                "image": {
                  "imageUrl": "/images/sao-tome-and-principe/st_principecam.png",
                  "imageLink": "https://maps.app.goo.gl/rMu2eGbM2tD2KF719",
                  "alt": "",
                  "width": 0.573
                },
                "text": [
                  "This desaturated and even dimmer variant of shitcam is most common on Príncipe."
                ]
              }
            },
            {
              "kind": "tip",
              "id": "YviS",
              "data": {
                "image": {
                  "imageUrl": "/images/sao-tome-and-principe/principe_car.png",
                  "imageLink": "https://maps.app.goo.gl/gFGYZg3wL1LP4acT9",
                  "alt": "",
                  "width": 0.573
                },
                "text": [
                  "The car used on Príncipe can be recognised by the **blue** roof and silver roof rails.",
                  "NOTE: Remember that it can sometimes be blurred out."
                ]
              }
            },
            {
              "kind": "tip",
              "id": "5DnQ",
              "data": {
                "image": {
                  "imageUrl": "/images/sao-tome-and-principe/sao_tome_car.png",
                  "imageLink": "https://maps.app.goo.gl/XNmPyAVxnjhpm81n7",
                  "alt": "",
                  "width": 0.573
                },
                "text": [
                  "The car used on São Tomé is **black** with black roof rails. In most locations, it is blurred out."
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "kind": "tip",
          "title": "Spotlight",
          "items": [
            {
              "kind": "tip",
              "id": "1vUE",
              "data": {
                "image": {
                  "imageUrl": "/images/sao-tome-and-principe/st_oilpalmplantation.png",
                  "imageLink": "https://goo.gl/maps/13XwZpCMeKqxn6wG7",
                  "alt": "",
                  "width": 0.573
                },
                "text": [
                  "You can find **oil palm plantations** in southern São Tomé."
                ]
              }
            },
            {
              "kind": "tip",
              "id": "5C59",
              "data": {
                "image": {
                  "imageUrl": "/images/sao-tome-and-principe/st_trinidadpolepaint.png",
                  "imageLink": "https://goo.gl/maps/1Aty7JQDMLYERf7N8",
                  "alt": "",
                  "width": 0.573
                },
                "text": [
                  "The town of Trinidade has poles with **red and white** pole paint."
                ]
              },
